1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:00,640
This device

2
00:00:00,640 --> 00:00:01,700
tells you exactly

3
00:00:01,700 --> 00:00:02,690
when you are dying.

4
00:00:02,690 --> 00:00:03,230
And he has

5
00:00:03,230 --> 00:00:04,330
just over two minutes

6
00:00:04,330 --> 00:00:05,210
to change it.

7
00:00:05,210 --> 00:00:06,110
Under the band,

8
00:00:06,110 --> 00:00:07,570
microscopic nano-sensors

9
00:00:07,570 --> 00:00:08,510
slip through his skin

10
00:00:08,510 --> 00:00:10,150
and race into his bloodstream.

11
00:00:10,150 --> 00:00:11,690
They sweep past blood cells,

12
00:00:11,690 --> 00:00:13,110
monitoring cellular decay

13
00:00:13,110 --> 00:00:14,230
and sending a constant

14
00:00:14,230 --> 00:00:15,380
stream of signals.

15
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:16,720
If an organ starts failing,

16
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:17,540
or his heart slips

17
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:18,770
into a lethal rhythm,

18
00:00:18,770 --> 00:00:19,750
the warning races

19
00:00:19,750 --> 00:00:20,820
back to his wrist.

20
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:22,510
The red screen keeps counting.

21
00:00:22,510 --> 00:00:24,130
Every second matters.

22
00:00:24,130 --> 00:00:25,610
His location and medical data

23
00:00:25,610 --> 00:00:27,050
reach a nearby hospital,

24
00:00:27,050 --> 00:00:28,130
where an emergency drone

25
00:00:28,130 --> 00:00:29,630
launches straight toward him.

26
00:00:29,630 --> 00:00:30,710
While help is coming,

27
00:00:30,710 --> 00:00:31,430
the band delivers

28
00:00:31,430 --> 00:00:32,850
an automatic injection,

29
00:00:32,850 --> 00:00:34,500
potentially buying him time.

30
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:35,520
His heartbeat steadies

31
00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:36,530
as he sits up.

32
00:00:36,530 --> 00:00:37,940
Green replaces red:

33
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:39,100
life expectancy,

34
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:40,300
forty-two years.

35
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:40,940
But that number

36
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:42,380
already changed once.

37
00:00:42,380 --> 00:00:43,760
If your countdown started,

38
00:00:43,760 --> 00:00:44,780
would you want to know?
